# Negative control — points the area nav's Overview tab back at the product
# ROOT, which `productRootRedirect` answers with an area of its own. On a
# product still owed its setup the tab then moves nowhere at all: the whole
# FE walkthrough defect 3, "product tabs do not work, only setup".
#
# Intended RED (both cases):
#   every product area tab reaches the page it names >
#     leaves no dead tab on a product still owed its setup
#     leaves no dead tab on a running product
#
# The PENDING case is the reported defect — Overview bounced back to Setup. The
# running one reds too because the root is a redirect POSITION for every
# product, so a tab aimed at it is dead whatever the status.

